target: cmd/looper/main.go
verify: go test ./cmd/looper/ -count=1 -run 'TestPrReportPostDefersAndReportsWhereTo'
expect: --- FAIL:
why:    os.Stdin is always an *os.File, so in production the mode check alone decides whether a narrative piped without -findings-file - is reported or dropped in silence. The first tests reached only the non-*os.File branch, and with this line made false for every pipe the whole tree stayed green — measured by the cycle-2 reviewer in a clean export.
--- old
	return err == nil && st.Mode()&os.ModeCharDevice == 0
--- new
	return err == nil && st.Mode()&os.ModeCharDevice == 0 && false
